  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Happy path",
      "items": [
        "CreateProductHandler and the raised event are generated from [CrudCreate]/[RaisesEvent] \u2014 nothing here calls AddEvent by hand; ProductConfigs, which maps the insert, is still hand-written like every entity mapping in this template",
        "The event is raised by the EF save hook after SaveChanges, not inside the handler"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Refusal",
      "items": [
        "CreateProductRequestValidator runs through the group's AddFluentValidationAutoValidation() filter before the generated handler",
        "A taken name short-circuits here with 409 \u2014 no insert, no event"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "What this cannot show",
      "items": [
        "[Range(0.01, double.MaxValue)] on price is forwarded onto the generated request but never evaluated \u2014 a negative price still reaches the insert and returns 201",
        "The Azure branch only fires when FeatureManagement:EnableServiceBus is true; Development ships it false, so only the in-memory handler runs"
      ]
    }
  ]
}